flowchart TD
  A[App / Home route] --> B[Functional DOM UI ready]
  B --> C[Production loading preview]
  C --> D{Realtime enabled + WebGL2 + valid config?}
  D -- No --> F[Tier F static fallback]
  D -- Yes --> E[Load final mascot + terminal core]
  E --> G{Core assets valid?}
  G -- No --> F
  G -- Yes --> H[Live Tier B conservative core]
  H --> I[Lazy secondary world / furniture]
  I --> J{Capability/runtime policy permits?}
  J -- Better --> K[Tier A]
  J -- Degrade --> L[Tier C]
  H --> M{Context loss / unrecoverable core fault?}
  K --> M
  L --> M
  M -- recoverable --> H
  M -- unrecoverable/repeated --> F
  F --> N[Same functional UI remains active]
  K --> N
  L --> N
  H --> N
